WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,110
this

2
00:00:01,250 --> 00:00:03,050
Didn't you suggest that I deal with them?

3
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:05,050
Why is the cost king so powerful again?

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,040
All are old classmates

5
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,240
Talking about money hurts feelings

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,400
But then again

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,840
Don't worry, brothers still have a name to settle accounts.

8
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,200
For the sake of old classmates

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,560
I'll give you a discount

10
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:18,560
Let this ghost beat us to pieces

11
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,720
Just to get money, what do you think, the bosses?

12
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,200
I'll save your life

13
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,480
How much should it be worth?

14
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,560
five five million

15
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,240
What are you still doing?

16
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:32,960
Didn't you hear they said they haven't been beaten enough by you? Who am I? Where am I? What am I going to do?
